rement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 18 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 18 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 18 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"EDA formal conclusion-এর আগে structure, quality, distribution, relationship ও anomaly-এর disciplined investigation। Reproducible sequence শিখুন।\" data-en=\"EDA is a disciplined investigation of structure, quality, distributions, relationships, and anomalies before formal conclusions. Learn a reproducible sequence.\">EDA is a disciplined investigation of structure, quality, distributions, relationships, and anomalies before formal conclusions. Learn a reproducible sequence.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 55 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"EDA-এর purpose explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain the purpose of EDA.\">Explain the purpose of EDA.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Structured EDA sequence follow করুন।\" data-en=\"Follow a structured EDA sequence.\">Follow a structured EDA sequence.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Univariate ও bivariate view appropriately ব্যবহার করুন।\" data-en=\"Use univariate and bivariate views appropriately.\">Use univariate and bivariate views appropriately.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Discovery ও confirmation আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Separate discovery from confirmation.\">Separate discovery from confirmation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"EDA-এর purpose\" data-en=\"Purpose of EDA\">Purpose of EDA</h2><p data-bn=\"EDA summary ও graphic দিয়ে data structure understand, problem detect, hypothesis generate, assumption assess ও deeper study-এর pattern identify করে। এটি unsupported story-এর fishing license নয়; finding check না হওয়া পর্যন্ত provisional।\" data-en=\"Exploratory data analysis uses summaries and graphics to understand data structure, detect problems, generate hypotheses, assess assumptions, and identify patterns worth deeper study. It is not a fishing license for unsupported stories; findings are provisional until checked.\">Exploratory data analysis uses summaries and graphics to understand data structure, detect problems, generate hypotheses, assess assumptions, and identify patterns worth deeper study. It is not a fishing license for unsupported stories; findings are provisional until checked.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Reliable sequence\" data-en=\"A reliable sequence\">A reliable sequence</h2><p data-bn=\"Question ও scope দিয়ে শুরু করুন। File, row, field, type, key ও time coverage inventory করুন। Missingness ও validity profile করুন। Numerical distribution ও categorical frequency examine করুন। Important group ও time pattern compare করুন। Anomaly investigate ও decision/open question document করুন।\" data-en=\"Start with question and scope. Inventory files, rows, fields, types, keys, and time coverage. Profile missingness and validity. Examine numerical distributions and categorical frequencies. Compare important groups and time patterns. Investigate anomalies. Document decisions and open questions.\">Start with question and scope. Inventory files, rows, fields, types, keys, and time coverage. Profile missingness and validity. Examine numerical distributions and categorical frequencies. Compare important groups and time patterns. Investigate anomalies. Document decisions and open questions.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Univariate, bivariate, multivariate\" data-en=\"Univariate, bivariate, multivariate\">Univariate, bivariate, multivariate</h2><p data-bn=\"Univariate এক variable-এর distribution, center, spread ও unusual value study করে। Bivariate দুই variable relationship। Multivariate several variable together। Simple দিয়ে শুরু করুন; complexity question answer করবে, report decorate নয়।\" data-en=\"Univariate analysis studies one variable: distribution, center, spread, and unusual values. Bivariate analysis studies relationships between two variables. Multivariate analysis considers several variables together. Begin simple; complexity should answer a question, not decorate a report.\">Univariate analysis studies one variable: distribution, center, spread, and unusual values. Bivariate analysis studies relationships between two variables. Multivariate analysis considers several variables together. Begin simple; complexity should answer a question, not decorate a report.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Exploration বনাম confirmation\" data-en=\"Exploration versus confirmation\">Exploration versus confirmation</h2><p data-bn=\"Same data-তে discovered pattern unstable হতে পারে। High-stakes decision-এ new data, pre-specified test, holdout period বা sensitivity analysis দিয়ে validate করুন। Exploratory finding clearly label করুন।\" data-en=\"Patterns discovered in the same data can be unstable. When decisions are high-stakes, validate findings with new data, pre-specified tests, holdout periods, or sensitivity analysis. Clearly label exploratory findings.\">Patterns discovered in the same data can be unstable. When decisions are high-stakes, validate findings with new data, pre-specified tests, holdout periods, or sensitivity analysis. Clearly label exploratory findings.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"EDA\" data-en=\"EDA\">EDA</h3><p data-bn=\"Summary ও visualization দিয়ে systematic data exploration।\" data-en=\"Systematic exploration of data using summaries and visualizations.\">Systematic exploration of data using summaries and visualizations.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Univariate\" data-en=\"Univariate\">Univariate</h3><p data-bn=\"একবারে এক variable analysis।\" data-en=\"Analysis of one variable at a time.\">Analysis of one variable at a time.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Bivariate\" data-en=\"Bivariate\">Bivariate</h3><p data-bn=\"দুই variable-এর relationship analysis।\" data-en=\"Analysis of the relationship between two variables.\">Analysis of the relationship between two variables.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Sensitivity analysis\" data-en=\"Sensitivity analysis\">Sensitivity analysis</h3><p data-bn=\"Reasonable alternative choice-এ conclusion change হয় কি না check করা।\" data-en=\"Checking whether conclusions change under reasonable alternative choices.\">Checking whether conclusions change under reasonable alternative choices.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Retail sales EDA\" data-en=\"EDA of retail sales\">EDA of retail sales</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Retail dataset-এ order date, region, category, quantity, revenue, discount ও profit আছে।\" data-en=\"The retail dataset contains order date, region, category, quantity, revenue, discount, and profit.\">The retail dataset contains order date, region, category, quantity, revenue, discount, and profit.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Row grain ও date coverage confirm করুন।\" data-en=\"Confirm row grain and date coverage.\">Confirm row grain and date coverage.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Missing, invalid ও duplicate record profile করুন।\" data-en=\"Profile missing, invalid, and duplicate records.\">Profile missing, invalid, and duplicate records.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Revenue, profit, quantity ও discount distribution summarize করুন।\" data-en=\"Summarize revenue, profit, quantity, and discount distributions.\">Summarize revenue, profit, quantity, and discount distributions.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Count, total, median ও rate দিয়ে category/region compare করুন।\" data-en=\"Compare categories and regions using counts, totals, medians, and rates.\">Compare categories and regions using counts, totals, medians, and rates.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Time pattern ও extreme loss investigate করুন।\" data-en=\"Examine time patterns and investigate extreme losses.\">Examine time patterns and investigate extreme losses.</p></li><li><span>6</span><p data-bn=\"Finding, limitation ও next question লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Write findings, limitations, and next questions.\">Write findings, limitations, and next questions.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"EDA evidence map ও quality report তৈরি করে; pattern কেন ঘটেছে automatically prove করে না।\" data-en=\"EDA creates an evidence map and quality report; it does not automatically prove why patterns occurred.\">EDA creates an evidence map and quality report; it does not automatically prove why patterns occurred.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"EDA question ও structure দিয়ে শুরু হয়।\" data-en=\"EDA begins with question and structure.\">EDA begins with question and structure.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Interpretation-এর আগে quality check।\" data-en=\"Quality checks come before interpretation.\">Quality checks come before interpretation.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Simple summary থেকে focused comparison-এ যান।\" data-en=\"Move from simple summaries to focused comparisons.\">Move from simple summaries to focused comparisons.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Exploratory pattern provisional।\" data-en=\"Exploratory patterns are provisional.\">Exploratory patterns are provisional.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/eda_d.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — Exploratory Data Analysis ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/ppc/section4/ppc41.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIST/SEMATECH — First Steps in Data Analysis ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}